Name: Private Join and Compute subset
Short Name: private-join-and-compute
URL: https://github.com/google/private-join-and-compute
Version: N/A
Revision: 08df854f9fa14304fb4f19df48c7b6bc31f140d3
Date: 2025-02-14
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: Apache-2.0
License File: src/LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
The package contains a communicative cipher. It's used to communicate with the leak detection Google server. The package is used from ip_protection component to re-randomize elgamal ciphers.

Local Modifications:
The patches are in patches/; copy.bara.sky applies them in this order.
0001-use-base-check.patch: Include base/check_op.h instead of
  absl/log/check.h.
0002-drop-openssl-init.patch: Drop the OpenSSLInit() call, which does
  nothing with BoringSSL.
0003-component-build-export.patch: Export the public classes for the
  component build, with base/private_join_and_compute_export.h.

Update instructions:
Update commit hashes in crowbar.txtpb, then run from this directory:
crowbar build --no-dry-run ./
copy.bara.sky lists every file it imports. If the new upstream version
adds a file Chromium needs, add it there and to BUILD.gn.
